  "structuring": {
    "prompt_additions": "CRITICAL: US subdivision numbering is INVERTED from Commonwealth. L1 subdivision uses letters: SUBSECTION (a), (b), (c). L2 uses Arabic numerals: PARAGRAPH (1), (2), (3). L3 uses uppercase letters: SUBPARAGRAPH (A), (B), (C). L4 uses lowercase Roman: CLAUSE (i), (ii), (iii). L5 uses uppercase Roman: SUBCLAUSE (I), (II), (III). Do NOT apply Commonwealth subsection-as-numeral conventions. Division and Subchapter levels have no Bluebell keyword — flag these for post-processing."
  },
